There are many ways in which the OSCAR pipeline can be improved, and many new features that 
should be added to it.  We therefore enthusiastically welcome contributions 
from others!  If you are interested in helping with the development of OSCAR, 
please contact the developers to discuss your ideas before embarking on the
coding journey, as such will help ensure the least overlap with ongoing efforts 
and the most efficient use of your time. 

